      "dc:source": "copyright-amendment-moral-rights-act-2000.pdf, p.28",
      "skos:note": "Appeal from a decision of a court under this Part Damages recovered in other proceedings are to be taken into account in proceedings under this Part. Court must consider negotiating a settlement before granting an injunction.",
